# Text files keep LF line endings on every system, also on Windows
# checkouts: the toolbox check compares files byte by byte (SHA-256), and
# the code's fingerprint (code_fingerprint) hashes their bytes
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mat binary
*.png binary
*.xlsx binary
# NBS 1.2 as distributed (NBSstats.m has CRLF line endings): unchanged bytes
3-[[:space:]]Analysis/fun/NBS/** -text
# Brainstorm fix applied by tools/fetch_toolboxes.sh: CRLF lines, as in Brainstorm's files
tools/*.patch -text
